<view class="page">
  <view class="map-wrap">
    <map
      id="routeMap"
      class="route-map"
      latitude="{{myLat || (cat ? cat.latitude : 0)}}"
      longitude="{{myLng || (cat ? cat.longitude : 0)}}"
      scale="15"
      markers="{{markers}}"
      polyline="{{polyline}}"
      include-points="{{includePoints}}"
      show-location="{{false}}"
    />
    <view class="map-badge" wx:if="{{locating}}">
      <text>{{myLat ? '计算路线中...' : '定位中...'}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="body">
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{cat}}">
      <view class="head">
        <text class="head-name">{{cat.name}}</text>
        <text class="tag tag-{{cat.lifeStatusClass}}">{{cat.lifeStatusText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="head-loc">📍 {{cat.locationDesc}}</view>

      <view class="metric" wx:if="{{distanceText}}">
        <view class="metric-main">
          <text class="metric-value">{{distanceText}}</text>
          <text class="metric-unit">{{routeSource === 'tencent' ? '步行路程' : '直线距离'}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="metric-sub">{{durationText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="note" wx:if="{{distanceText && routeSource !== 'tencent'}}">
        服务端还没有配腾讯位置服务的 key，所以这是两点直线距离。配好 key 后这里会变成真实步行路线。
      </view>
      <view class="note" wx:if="{{distanceText && routeSource === 'tencent'}}">
        折线是腾讯路线规划给出的步行路线，点「打开地图导航」可以直接照着走。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:if="{{!cat}}">
      <text class="head-loc">加载中...</text>
    </view>

    <view class="error" wx:if="{{errorMsg}}">
      <text>{{errorMsg}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-bar">
    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{!cat || !cat.latitude}}" bindtap="onOpenMap">
      打开地图导航
    </button>
    <button class="btn-outline" bindtap="locate">重新定位</button>
  </view>
</view>
